        You are about to install the package InBox Skins.
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;strong&gt;REQUIRED InBox PACKAGES&lt;/strong&gt;
        &lt;ul&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;InBox Core-7.0.1&lt;/li&gt;
            &lt;li&gt;Check before installing that you have no changes to the file interfaceCustomer.pm&lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;/ul&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        &lt;br&gt;
        Service Up will receive a notification by e-mail about the installation of this solution. By clicking forward, you are agreeing with this condition.
        &lt;br&gt;
        ((enjoy))
